SUMMARY:The Rolling Blackouts at Redwood Cafe
DESCRIPTION:Rolling Blackout is a force of nature. With an extensive and ever-growing catalog of all original material\, this band isn’t just playing; they’re forging a path that blends everything from the deep soul of blues to the crushing weight of heavy metal. It is raw\, visceral\, emotive\, improvisational but also thoughtful\, calculated and constructed. \n  \nBand Members\nJoshua Landman – Guitar\, Vocals\, Synths\nBill Chapman – Bass\, Vocals\, Synths\nErick Goldman – Drums\nJohn Palumbo – Guitar\, Backup Vocals \n  \n 
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/rolling-blackouts-at-redwood-cafe/
LOCATION:Redwood Cafe\, 8240 Old Redwood Hwy\, Cotati\, CA
CATEGORIES:Music
