SUMMARY:Thursday Night Dead at Cloverdale Arts Alliance
DESCRIPTION:The people behind Friday Night Live gratefully introduce you to Thursday Night Dead! \nAfter a sold-out Grateful Dead themed acoustic show at our March Americana Night\, the audience pleaded for more. We listened\, and let our life proceed by it’s own design. Thursday\, May 14 will be the premiere of the Cloverdale Arts Alliance’s newest endeavor\, Thursday Night Dead. \nThis series will run October through May on the second Thursday of the month. \nThe resident house band is The Might As Well Band\, featuring prominent local musicians Steve Pile\, Jay Wilcox\, Matt Petruska\, Sam Betty\, and Rhyne Erde. \nAn acoustic exploration of the Grateful Dead musical landscape and beyond. Taking place in the Cloverdale Arts Alliance Gallery. Once in a while you get shown the light. In the strangest of places\, if you look at it right. \nNothing left to do but smile\, smile\, smile. \nDoors open at 7:00 pm. Music starts at 7:30 pm. \nAdvance seated tickets are $30 (plus fees). Advance dance floor only tickets are $20 (plus fees). \nAll tickets\, if any remain\, will be sold at the door for $35.
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/thursday-night-dead-at-cloverdale-arts-alliance/
LOCATION:Cloverdale Arts Alliance Gallery\, 204 N. Cloverdale Blvd\, Cloverdale\, CA
CATEGORIES:Music
GEO:38.8071;-123.018
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=Cloverdale Arts Alliance Gallery 204 N. Cloverdale Blvd Cloverdale CA;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=204 N. Cloverdale Blvd:geo:-123.018,38.8071
END:VEVENT
